00:39:12,600 --> 00:39:14,600
[AGNES]
Hi!
ສະບາຍດີ!

669
00:39:15,100 --> 00:39:17,100
[GRU]
You brought the girls?
ເຈົ້າເອົາເດັກຍິງມາບໍ?

670
00:39:17,600 --> 00:39:19,600
[DR. NEFARIO]
Yes!  Oh.     Was that wrong?
